Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 06:51:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] atmos-shadows-1: fitted, blended, steady sun shadows with
 a quality setting

- SunShadows fits the 4 cascades to the follow camera (first ends just past the player),
  blends splits, lowers depth bias and keeps a moderate normal bias.
- The sun's shadow direction steps by 0.1 degrees instead of turning every frame, so
  Godot's texel snapping holds and edges stop crawling.
- Options > Shadows: Low (2048, 2 splits, 40 m), Medium (4096, 4, 60 m), High (8192, 4, 70 m).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
